vironment/surround to see the detail):\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e439df4-8ad4-4f54-9243-9db1579eef16)\r\n\r\n**Notes to reviewers:**\r\n- The intent is for debanding to **only and always** be applied after any encoding transformation (linear/nonlinear) has been applied and as the final step before quantization to integer values. Please let me know if you can think of or discover a scenario where this may not be the case with this PR!\r\n- Please let me know if you can think of any other ways to improve performance\r\n- My first time working with a lot of this code, so I might be making bad assumptions\r\n- I haven't tested with XR and I'm not sure that debanding is always being applied correctly as the last step before quantization to integer values\r\n\r\n**My test project**\r\n[color-correction-debanding-fixed.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21128944/color-correction-debanding-fixed.zip)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creat